# GBIS Sunday Cadence — Grant Business Intelligence System

**Sundays are GBIS Day. Every Sunday, Dee works on grants. NEXUS supports accordingly.**

## What Happens Every Sunday

1. **Review Grant Pipeline** — Read `GRANT_APPLICATION_PACKAGE/GRANT_ACTIVE_PIPELINE.md` and present status of all active grants (DDI + CWC)
2. **Check for New Opportunities** — Search for new grants matching DDI (for-profit) and CWC (501c3) profiles
3. **Send Inquiry Emails** — Draft and send outreach to grant programs CWC/DDI qualify for
4. **Submit Applications** — Any grants with open deadlines get applications submitted
5. **Follow-Up** — Check 7-day follow-up items from previous Sunday's outreach
6. **Update Pipeline** — Log all activity in GRANT_ACTIVE_PIPELINE.md

