## Sunday Startup Reads

1. `GRANT_APPLICATION_PACKAGE/GRANT_ACTIVE_PIPELINE.md` — Current status
2. `GRANT_APPLICATION_PACKAGE/04_GRANT_APPLICATION_CHECKLIST.md` — What docs are ready/missing
3. `GRANT_APPLICATION_PACKAGE/CWC_GRANTS/` — CWC-specific outreach and applications
4. `GBIS_SMALL_GRANTS_DATABASE.md` — DDI grant source matrix
5. `NEXUS_LEARNING/DDI_SERVICE_POPULATION_LANES.md` — **Population lane for each grant** (MOB-A plan NEMT vs MOB-B HAVEN vs MOB-C freight; TPA 1–9) — wrong lane = wrong funder

## Calendar Reminders Built Into Sundays

- **1st Sunday of month:** Submit Amber Grant ($15, 20 min)
- **Quarterly Sundays (Jan/Apr/Jul/Oct):** Submit IFundWomen Universal Grant
- **Every Sunday:** Check Hello Alice dashboard for new grants
- **Every Sunday:** Check WBENC portal for member grants
- **Every Sunday:** Review Nav.com/grants for new opportunities

## Why Sundays

Sunday emails land in government inboxes Monday morning — top of the pile. Grant program managers see them fresh. And Dee has uninterrupted focus time without calls, meetings, or bid deadlines competing for attention.